{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2804","id":2926518027,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886ubx8L","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2804","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2804.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2804.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2804","number":2804,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Expose pending interactive registrations via admin API","user":{"login":"oneingan","id":810075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDA3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan","html_url":"https://github.com/oneingan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #2736\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nInitial draft PR to expose pending interactive registrations via the admin API (gRPC endpoint). This enables external services to list pending registration IDs and details for approval workflows. CLI support is not yet included—feedback welcome on whether to add it here.\r\n\r\nNot ready for merge; seeking early feedback on design and implementation.\r\n\r\n## Key Changes\r\n\r\n- **gRPC API**: Added `ListPendingRegistrations` RPC to retrieve pending registrations from in-memory cache (ID, hostname, machine/node keys, expiry).\r\n- **State Management**: New `ListPendingRegistrations` method in `hscontrol/state` to snapshot cache entries as `PendingRegistration` structs.\r\n- **Protobuf**: Added `PendingRegistration` message and related request/response types in `proto/headscale/v1/headscale.proto`.\r\n- **Helpers**: New `hscontrol/types/pending_registration.go` for proto construction.\r\n- Generated files updated accordingly.\r\n\r\nNo persistence changes; aligns with in-memory cache design.\r\n\r\n## Open Questions\r\n\r\n- Add CLI commands (e.g., `headscale pending list` / `approve <id>`)?\r\n- Filtering options (e.g., by expiry, hostname)?\r\n- Auth for new endpoint?\r\n- Testing/docs TODO.\r\n\r\nReview diff and suggest improvements!","created_at":"2025-10-18T10:07:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T19:19:39Z","closed_at":"2026-05-01T10:46:15Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","ur